      "parent_ids": [
        "69d54a8916e0868130d59cc8920c153be8659be6"
      ],
      "title": "dhcpv6: allow RFC9686 message types to use Client FQDN",
      "message": "dhcpv6: allow RFC9686 message types to use Client FQDN\n\nDowngraded the error to a warning, and removed the break so\nthat FQDN decoding proceeds (and is visible - WireShark is a\ndisassembler after all).\n\n[RFC 9686 §4.2]\nThe ADDR-REG-INFORM message ... MAY include other options, such as\nthe Client FQDN option [RFC4704].\n\nfix incorrect indent\n",
      "author_name": "Paul Donald",
      "author_email": "newtwen+gitlab@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2025-12-20T16:24:57.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "Paul Donald",
      "committer_email": "newtwen+gitlab@gmail.com",
